  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0.6: new property apiUrl, for a self-hosted BugsRadar only. The appender keeps out only the package's own logger, BugsRadar.Client; your own BugsRadar.* loggers are reported now. Requires BugsRadar 3.0.0.6, which fixes the ILogger provider and the casing of property names. 3.0.0.5: no code changes; the author of the package is now BistriySpzoo, the same as the owner on nuget.org. 3.0.0.4: no code changes; the README and the package links point to the new documentation pages at bugsradar.com. 3.0.0.3: first version. The BugsRadar appender for log4net, configured in log4net.config.",
